# Build context hygiene: without this the daemon receives the virtualenv, the
# node_modules tree, and a stale frontend/dist on every build.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
backend/tests/
*.md
.env
*.env
data/
